      "btf_note": "BTF is not a direct CONFIG_BPF_LSM Kconfig dependency; it is retained for the actual BTF-based LSM program attach/CO-RE runtime. DWARF4 with pahole >=1.16 satisfies the 6.12 BTF Kconfig; installed SSD pahole is 1.30. Full function tracing is not required.",
