      "root_cause": "QEMU virt.c creates a PL061 device and points gpio-keys/poweroff at it. CONFIG_KEYBOARD_GPIO=y binds the consumer, but CONFIG_GPIO_PL061=n omits its GPIO supplier; gpiolib-of returns -EPROBE_DEFER when the GPIO device is absent.",
